{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And they stripped.</b> We do not find the form of הצלה from the kal stem, only from the nifal or the pi'el [dagesh], and both are transitive verbs, for there is no difference in meaning between וינצלו and ויצל אלהים (Genesis 31:9), except that in the nifal the object is expressed, but not so in the pi'el."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:51.030233111Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}